			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Normalize Unicode control characters and emoji spacing across documentation\n\nReplace literal multi-byte whitespace characters (U+2001, U+2009) with their HTML entity equivalents (&#x2001;) throughout all Cocoon documentation to prevent rendering and encoding issues across different platforms and editors.\n\nAlso collapse multi-line table cell content into single lines in Architecture.md and DeepDive.md, correct file path references from `Source/Effect/` to `Source/Service/Effect/` to match the current directory layout, remove references to the removed `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` module, and add consistent component emoji annotations (e.g., `Mountain⛰️`, `Vine🌿`, `Sky🌌`) to README.md.\n\nAll 7 documentation files updated: Architecture.md, CocoonImplementationPlan.md, CocoonImplementationSummary.md, DeepDive.md, RefactoringStrategy.md, VsCodeValidationChecklist.md, README.md.",
